All regular meetings of the board of commissioners should follow an established order of business. The order is as follows:
(1) Call to order;
(2) Minutes;
(3) Announcements;
(4) Invited guests;
(5) Bid openings;
(6) Reports from committees and departments;
(7) Public participation on agenda items;
(8) Consent agenda;
(9) Old business;
(10) New business;
(11) Public participation on non-agenda items;
(12) Adjournment.
(Res. No. 99-01(A), § 1-10, 1-12-1999; Res. No. 14-12, § 1, 5-13-2014)
